WEBVTT

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:11.800
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:17.410
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.750
Protocol Omega's Beta.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:38.260
I didn't expect her to be their leader.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.330
Are you ready, Tasuke?

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.940
S-Sure!

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.100
Hello!

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:28.190
Tasuke!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:29.540
Tenma.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:31.770
Give Tasuke and the others back!

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.090
You're...!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:37.480
Beta!

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:43.730
Are these the guys our lady of the crimson chrysanthemums spoke of?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:48.670
Whoever gets in the way of our lady will have to beat down the White Deer Gang first.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:49.590
What?

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:54.070
That Beta has the White Deer Gang under mind control.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.350
What should we do with them, my lady?

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:58.040
Let me see...

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:02.110
Maybe I'll give them back to you if you beat us.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:03.790
Through soccer, of course.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:09.560
But if you lose, you're all mine.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.780
This is to save everyone! We'll do it!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.520
But we need five more people.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.220
Fei, can you bring out the Dupli again?

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.150
Yeah, okay.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.730
1, 2, 3, 4, 5.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.500
There's exactly five here.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.360
Why not let them join you?

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:31.190
You guys are good at ball kicking, aren't you?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.330
Y-Yeah.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.280
So, how about it?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.270
Well, yeah, if I don't use the Dupli, I'll be able to spend more energy in my own plays.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.330
Then it's settled.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.290
Hey! How dare you make decisions without the coach's approval!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.690
What, is it a bad idea?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.490
No, we'll go with it!

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.360
Wondeba Switch On!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.360
What is this?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.020
It's Raimon's uniform!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.780
Uniform?

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.050
These garments are so easy to move in!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.470
The uniform is proof that we're a team.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:12.650
It's important as it symbolizes that we're all friends fighting for the same goal.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.870
A symbol of friendship...

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.110
So it's like armor that you wear into battle!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.470
Oh, I see!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.440
When I wear this, I feel like I can't lose.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.610
Okay then, everyone! Let's go!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:25.910
Yeah!

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:30.000
You made a pretty bold move there, adding them to the team.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.970
I'm sure those kids want revenge on the White Deer Gang, too.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:36.640
What's most important here is their desire to win.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.250
I see.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.490
Honey, is the okonomiyaki ready?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.920
Yeah, almost done!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.770
Then I'll arrange it on the plate...

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.400
And he's gone again!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.960
Whoa! Why do I have a mic and...

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:53.910
A c-conch shell?

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.440
Now, the match is ready to begin!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.420
A battle between Raimon's composite team and the White Deer Gang!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.470
We kickoff in the Sengoku era!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.610
Takuto-sama! Tasuke!

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:09.860
Let's go.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.470
The match begins!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:12.830
Okay!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.080
Tasuke, move up!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.160
Move up where?

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.800
To the other goal.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:18.330
Goal?

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.900
Why aren't they moving?

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:22.910
Dunno...

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:24.690
O-Oh no!

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.550
They don't know how to play soccer!

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:31.190
What do you have to say for yourself, Toukichirou?!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.220
Hey, that's not my fault.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.470
He's right.

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:35.910
What do we do, Wondeba-san?!

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:39.260
What a fool.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.390
C'mon, men! Make them scatter!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.110
Mark him! You've got to block them!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.230
Shishimaru, stop him!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.220
Stop him how...?

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:56.730
Swallow Counter!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.160
Shishimaru!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:03.270
Take that!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:04.690
The ball is centered to Kudou!

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:06.650
This is ours!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.410
Let's go!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.110
Arquebus...

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:13.910
Bullet!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.300
It's in! Goalkeeper Nishizono couldn't reach it!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.520
The White Deer Gang makes the first goal!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.840
That was such a powerful shoot...

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:31.130
That power must have been given to them by Beta.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:32.830
What a nuisance.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.550
And there are five of us who are first-timers at soccer.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.500
The match resumes! Will Raimon be able to strike back?!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.020
Tasuke!

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:49.000
Try dribbling first.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.410
Use short movements to keep kicking the ball as you run!

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:52.760
L-Like this?

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.380
Good, you're doing great!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.190
Next is passing!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:58.630
Kick the ball to the other person's legs so that they can receive it!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:01.630
I did it!

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.830
Good job, Tasuke!

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.630
You're not taking another step!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.800
Tsurugi gets past Ochimura!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.470
Tasuke!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.470
Okay, I'll try this!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.880
Tasuke charges past the two with dribbling!

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.080
Yes!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.580
I'm starting to understand what this soccer is about!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.610
Okay!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:27.110
I won't lose to Tasuke!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.420
What's with those knocking knees?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.690
Take this!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.100
Okehazama Wall!

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:37.660
Shishimaru!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.320
The White Deer Gang make a severe defense!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.740
I'll have to use Avatar Armed!

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.550
Like we'd let you!

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:48.800
Tenma!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.470
They're keeping us from bringing out our Avatars!

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.800
Then I'll do it!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:00.410
Tsurugi!

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.470
I won't let you.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.130
Crush them, {my bitches}men!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.630
Now, the White Deer Gang moves up!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.160
Tighten the defense!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.750
I have to do whatever it takes to defend here!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.970
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.220
Armed!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.360
Why can't I do it?!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.110
Ghost Demon Kamaitachi!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.470
Whirlwind Blade!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.080
Shin-sama!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.360
Takuto-sama!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.190
No matter what you try, it's useless!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.920
Arquebus...

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.330
Bullet!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.670
It's in!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:55.020
The White Deer Gang makes their second goal! Raimon falls behind!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:00.550
The first half is over!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.360
As I expected, it's difficult fighting with an improvised team.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.050
Sorry. I couldn't protect the goal.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.130
Shinsuke...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:14.360
I hate to say it, but the White Deer Gang plays good soccer!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.870
Beta's strategies mesh well with the White Deer Gang's disposition.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.660
Compared to them, we're...

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.550
I'm sorry, Tenma.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:25.360
We're dragging you down...

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.410
That's not true.

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.860
No, they <i>are</i>  dragging you down.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.770
Hey, this was <i>your</i>  idea!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:34.360
That's why.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.360
Listen up, you lot.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:39.550
Do as I say for the next round.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.910
I've got a plan that will work!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:50.640
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.820
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:59.800
Now, the second half is ready to start!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.310
Raimon has changed their formation!

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:07.020
Their forward Tasuke is moved back to defense and Tsurugi is on his own!

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.830
Is this a plan to strengthen their defense?!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.770
Will this really work?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.770
From what I can see, the White Deer Gang has excellent offense...

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.270
...but their defense seems weak.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:21.300
If we're able to hold back the enemy's attack with my plan...

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.250
...we may be able to plunge right into enemy lines as they crumple around us.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.470
But they kept attacking us in the first half.

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.250
Will this really be all right?

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.410
Let's go!

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.130
You got it!

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.690
Maebayashi breaks through the center!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:43.130
Is Raimon cowed by his fierce charge? They aren't going for the ball!

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.970
They're intimidated by us!

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.800
Then we'll crush them with one blow!

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.520
Move, move, move!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.910
Okay, it's going as planned.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.750
They're coming! Are you ready?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.000
Y-Yeah!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.460
We'll do it!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.020
Move!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:58.910
Now!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.130
Let's go!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:04.250
Shishimaru and Ichimasa attack Maebayashi on both sides with a sliding!

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:06.410
There!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.560
What?!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:13.560
Raimon stops Maebayashi's charge with a three-man defense!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.660
Yes!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:15.880
They really stopped them!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:18.940
Tenma!

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.280
The ball goes to Matsukaze!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.380
Raimon counterattacks!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.580
I'll score this time!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.940
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.630
Armed!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.030
W-What's with that appearance?!

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.820
It's in!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:04.600
Raimon makes an excellent counterattack to take back a point!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.070
You did it, Tsurugi!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.230
Yes!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.700
Hold back the enemy's attack and plunge right in, huh?

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.790
It was a brilliant plan.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.640
Right?

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:26.430
I was sweating buckets when you said to focus the White Deer Gang's attack on Tasuke and the newbies.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.970
It seemed to me that Tasuke is better at defending than attacking.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:35.760
I just put him together with others who are also better at defending.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:42.280
If you can't beat the enemy with one person, with three it will work out somehow.

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:47.680
He was able to assess their abilities by only looking at a few of their plays?

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:50.380
We sure gave them a scare!

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:53.080
Yeah, we can do this too!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.510
Let's take back the friends they've kidnapped!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:56.670
We'll win no matter what!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.100
Yeah!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.570
They want to protect their friends...

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:04.080
Those strong feelings of theirs are what helped them to stop the ball!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.700
I can't lose to them!

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:11.210
Now, the match resumes!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.110
The White Deer Gang attacks in great leaps and bounds!

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.420
They're already in front of Raimon's goal!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:21.660
We'll crush you so hard that you'll never stand again!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:22.590
They're fast!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.060
Men, make it in!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.290
Right!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.290
Arquebus...

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.150
Bullet!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.260
I'll protect it!

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:37.790
I have something I want to protect, too!

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:43.730
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.890
To protect our soccer!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.360
Armed!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.220
He blocks it!

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.920
Nishizono firmly catches the ball using Avatar Armed!

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.500
I did it...

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.120
I did Avatar Armed, too!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.320
Shinsuke!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:16.780
He did Avatar Armed!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.520
Whoa!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.140
You did it, Shinsuke!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:21.630
Yeah!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.570
Okay, time to strike back!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.700
Now, Raimon goes for the counter!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.050
Nishiki, hold back the sides!

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:31.180
Right!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.910
Tenma, Tsurugi, move up for the attack!

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.490
Okay!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.110
Shishimaru!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.690
Shindou has superb control of the players' movements!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.820
This is God's Baton!

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.790
Takuto-sama...

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:48.180
Let's go!

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:55.110
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.110
Bushin Renzan!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:10.400
It's in! Raimon makes in a tie!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.320
Yes!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.850
Not bad, Nishiki!

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:17.070
Our attacks don't work?

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.350
W-What do we do now, my lady?!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.740
That's all it takes for you to lose your will to fight?

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.320
How pathetic.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.300
I think this is enough.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:29.570
Losers should go ahead and lose.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.900
Okay, let's go!

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.370
Yeah!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:46.150
Denrai Houtou!

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:56.480
Death Drop!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.850
Jingo, pass to Ichimasa!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.820
Ichimasa, make a centering to Tasuke!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.180
Tasuke jumps in front of the goal, he's unmarked!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.410
So close, the shoot hits the post!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.700
Don't get cocky!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.100
Grab it!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.130
Right!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.600
Aggressive Beat!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.740
True Mach Wind!

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.660
The match ends!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.970
Raimon makes a huge comeback!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.510
The White Deer Gang falls greatly behind!

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:44.700
Yes!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.480
We beat the White Deer Gang!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.880
Shinsuke!

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:49.990
You completed Avatar Armed!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:51.610
Yeah, I did!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.880
Congrats.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:53.390
Yeah!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.780
Why the long face?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.880
We won't take this sitting down.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:00.650
Let's do our best!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.290
Yeah!

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.570
Just where do you think you're going?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.810
You're going to spill on where you've taken those kidnapped children!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.330
Imagawa Yoshimoto?!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:21.350
Lord Imagawa ordered us to bring in children so they can be made into soldiers.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.090
Make children into soldiers?

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:25.740
That's unforgivable!

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:28.370
Why would he need to do such a thing?

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.790
I've heard of this.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:35.820
Recently, there has been talk that he needs many soldiers to proceed to the capital.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.910
I'm sorry. The plan has failed.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.420
I don't understand.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:51.280
The plan would have worked if we hadn't gone about it so roundabout.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:55.910
We could have defeated them ourselves without using the White Deer Gang.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:05.780
If we intervene with history deeply enough to leave scars,
there is a risk of inducing the collapse of the time paradox.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:11.140
If that were to happen, a black hole will sprout within the timeline and that is dangerous.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.920
Don't be too eager.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:14.070
Then what do you suggest?

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:18.120
We will use those who are in opposition against Nobunaga.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:20.950
Imagawa Yoshimoto.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:25.300
We will use his historical circumstances to complete the mission.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.030
I see.

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.890
Once you have him, await further orders.

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:30.910
Yes, master.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:36.600
I can't believe Imagawa Yoshimoto was behind the White Deer Gang.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:41.270
It's said that he's the closest in this time period to obtaining rule over the entire country.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:43.310
That's dumb.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.520
It's Nobunaga-sama who is the closest to ruling the country.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.050
Imagawa is no enemy.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:57.740
That's true. Historically speaking, Nobunaga crushed Imagawa Yoshimoto in the Battle of Okehazama.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:03.950
But with Protocol Omega meddling with the timeline, there's no guarantee that it will turn out that way.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:11.350
It'll grow even harder for us to approach Nobunaga once the battles start.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.860
We'll have to do it before then.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.250
But how do we sneak into the banquet for cherry blossom viewing?

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.470
Shin-sama?

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:41.940
Shinsuke managed to complete Avatar Armed.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:52.550
I need to hurry with achieving Mixi-max with Nobunaga.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.210
You're very good.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:59.990
It's like you're dancing with the moon.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:00.840
Okatsu-san.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.150
Are you not able to sleep?

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.670
Is something troubling you?

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:13.680
No, I was just thinking how we would be able to meet Nobunaga.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.610
I see.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.620
You're standing too close to Shin-sama!

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:23.350
Once you meet Nobunaga-sama, you'll leave, won't you.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.720
Um... that is...

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:34.050
I would feel sad not being able to see the dance-like moves of your kemari anymore.

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:35.050
Okatsu-san.

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:39.710
Shin-sama's lifting is like a beautiful dance.

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.150
That may be true.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.130
Shin-sama, that's it!

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:50.250
We're going to dress up as dancers?!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.470
This is our best option.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:59.970
By sneaking into the banquet for cherry blossom viewing held by Nobunaga, we will have another chance to Mixi-max with him.

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:04.610
How to sneak in was our biggest problem, but...

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.370
As dancers, no one will be wary of us and we'll get close to Nobunaga... right?

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:10.860
What a wonderful idea!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.800
All right, everyone, time to change!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.960
Disguise yourselves as cute dancers and make contact with Nobunaga!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:21.310
Also known as, the Great Dancer Strategy!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.100
I'm getting all revved up!

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.800
We're really going to do this?!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:57.460
The Raimon Eleven make their shocking transformation into dancers!

00:22:57.460 --> 00:23:01.240
Just you wait, Nobunaga! We'll get the Mixi-max to work!

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.860
Next, Infiltration! The Great Dancer Strategy!!

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.320
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:19.540
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:26.750
The uniform is proof that we're a team. 
 It's important as it symbolizes our friendship!

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.070
That's all!
